<title>POLAND: Polish yr/yr PPI in July flat at 9.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish yr/yr PPI in July flat at 9.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish producer prices rose 0.6 percent in July against a 0.4 percent rise in June, keeping year-on-year producer price inflation flat at 9.5 percent, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said producer prices rose 5.2 percent in the January-July period, compared with a 6.2 percent rise in the corresponding period last year.</p>
<p> POLISH PRODUCER INFLATION	  JULY	 JUNE     JULY  96</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)		0.6	 0.4(0.3)   0.7</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)			9.5	 9.5(9.4)  11.4</p>
<p>  manufacturing m/m change	     0.6	 0.4(0.3)   0.5</p>
<p>  manufacturing yr/yr change	   8.2	 8.1(8.0)  10.0</p>
<p>  mining m/m change			1.1	 1.1(0.5)   4.7</p>
<p>  mining yr/yr change		   16.2	17.9(17.2) 17.0</p>
<p>  utilities m/m change		   0.3	 0.1	  0.0</p>
<p>  utilities yr/yr change		11.3	11.1	 12.0</p>
<p>Note - Revised data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
